<h1>Q11: ASP.NET Core MVC Project Structure</h1>
<p>The application is running successfully.</p>

<h2>Structure</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Controllers/</strong> - handles HTTP requests</li>
    <li><strong>Views/</strong> - Razor user-interface files</li>
    <li><strong>Models/</strong> - application data and business objects</li>
    <li><strong>wwwroot/</strong> - static files such as CSS and JavaScript</li>
    <li><strong>Program.cs</strong> - service registration and request routing</li>
</ul>
